+- `src/<ctx>/index.ts`: `BoundedContext.create({ name, controllers, internalHandlers, externalHandlers, registry })`.
+- `src/<ctx>/registry.ts`: `INSTANCE_REGISTRY` with mock/integration/real repo bindings; `import './errors'`.
